{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29614","headline":"哀筝 · 李商隐","name":"哀筝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"延颈全同鹤，柔肠素怯猿。\n湘波无限泪，蜀魄有余冤。\n轻幰长无道，哀筝不出门。\n何由问香炷，翠幕自黄昏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29614.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29614","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}